WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:09.197
This repository's Claude Code settings brought a new hook, so they wait for the owner's trust. The workers on this canvas run on Codex, which never reads those settings.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.688
Until now, a Codex worker refused to start in such a repository at all.

00:00:16.842 --> 00:00:30.368
With the change, the same card in the same repository starts. Codex says what it will do and gets to work, while the Claude Code settings stay held. Until they are trusted, Codex asks before every command, even one their allow list names.

00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:39.077
So held Claude Code settings no longer stop Codex workers. Review cards of outside contributions stay refused for Codex.
